<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow"/><title>A season worth showing up for | Gametime partnership proposal</title><meta name="description" content="A parent-led proposal for Gametime to support Triangle 13 Black National's 2027 season."/><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg"/><SocialMeta title="A season worth showing up for | Gametime partnership proposal" description="A parent-led invitation for Gametime to support Triangle 13 Black National’s 2027 season." /></head><body class="pitch-page"><a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a><div class="preview-bar">DISCUSSION DRAFT <span>Prepared for Gametime · not an existing sponsorship</span></div><header class="header wrap"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand-symbol">13</span><span>TRIANGLE <b>13 BLACK / NATIONAL</b></span></a><a class="text-link" href="/">Explore the team ↗</a></header><main id="main"><section class="wrap pitch-hero"><p class="eyebrow">A PARTNERSHIP PROPOSAL FOR GAMETIME</p><h1>GREAT MEMORIES<br />START WITH<br /><span>SHOWING UP.</span></h1><p class="lead">Help a team of young athletes experience everything a season of sport can be.</p><p>A parent-led invitation to support Triangle 13 Black National.<br />Raleigh, North Carolina · 2026–27 season</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="#proposal">Explore the partnership ↓</a><button class="text-link" id="print">Print this pitch ↗</button></div></section><section class="section wrap story"><div><p class="eyebrow">WHY GAMETIME + THIS TEAM</p><h2>You help fans<br />get in the game.<br />Help them stay in it.</h2></div><div><p class="lead">The connection is simple: sports bring people together.</p><p>Gametime describes its purpose around making memories and enabling shared live experiences. A youth volleyball season brings that idea to life through road trips, tough matches, new confidence, and families cheering together.</p><p>One of your teammates is also a parent on this team. This is an opportunity to support an employee’s community with a focused, tangible partnership.</p><p class="fine">Brand connection based on <a href="https://gametime.co/company/about/">Gametime’s About page</a>. This is a proposed community partnership, not a statement of Gametime’s giving policy or an approved campaign.</p></div></section><section class="impact" id="proposal"><div class="section wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE CONVERSATION STARTER</p><h2>One team.<br /><span>A $5,000 assist.</span></h2><p class="lead">A proposed season partnership to help offset the costs families carry.</p><p>For our 10-player planning budget, an equally shared $5,000 contribution would represent $500 per athlete. The final allocation would be agreed with the team.</p><p>Start with a focused use of funds—such as family travel support—and a simple report showing how it was used.</p></div><div class="cost-card"><p class="eyebrow">WHAT THE PARTNERSHIP COULD INCLUDE</p><h2>Support they feel.<br />A story you can share.</h2><ul class="pitch-list"><li><b>Community impact</b><br/>An agreed contribution to team families’ season expenses.</li><li><b>A visible thank-you</b><br/>Featured recognition on the parent-led sponsor page.</li><li><b>Updates with substance</b><br/>A midseason note, final season recap, and aggregate expense summary.</li><li><b>A shared experience</b><br/>Explore a team outing to a live sporting event, separately scoped and approved.</li></ul></div></div></section><section class="section wrap"><p class="eyebrow">THREE WAYS TO PARTICIPATE</p><div class="sponsor-grid"><article class="sponsor-card"><h3>$2,500</h3><p>Team travel partner</p><ul><li>A focused contribution toward family travel expenses</li><li>Website recognition and a season recap</li></ul></article><article class="sponsor-card featured"><h3>$5,000</h3><p>Season partner · proposed starting ask</p><ul><li>Broader support across the team</li><li>Featured website recognition</li><li>Midseason and final impact updates</li></ul></article><article class="sponsor-card"><h3>Custom</h3><p>Experience or matching partner</p><ul><li>Explore tickets or credit for a team outing, subject to availability and terms</li><li>Explore employee giving or matching, if available</li></ul></article></div><p class="fine">These are proposed options, not agreed commitments. Any ticket experience, matching program, brand use, or public storytelling requires separate confirmation. No athlete endorsement or club-owned advertising inventory is included.</p></section><section class="legacy"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">A CLEAR CASE FOR SUPPORT</p><h2>Ambition is big.<br />The expenses are, too.</h2><div class="pitch-budget"><div><h3>10 players. Seven travel trips.</h3><p>We estimate $1,500 per athlete for food, transportation, and lodging on each away trip: six scheduled away tournaments plus one national championship.</p><p>That adds $10,500 per athlete in estimated food and travel costs. The backup qualifier is excluded; local events carry no travel allowance.</p><p class="fine">Dues and uniform source: <a href={guide}>2027 Triangle 13s program guide, revised September 9, 2026</a>. Travel is a parent planning estimate, not a published club charge. Schedule subject to change.</p></div><SeasonBudget /></div></div></section><section class="section wrap story"><div><p class="eyebrow">A SMALL, WELL-DEFINED NEXT STEP</p><h2>Let’s shape<br />the right fit.</h2></div><div><p class="lead">A short conversation with the right person at Gametime.</p><ol class="pitch-list"><li>Identify the owner for community partnerships, employee engagement, or brand sponsorships.</li><li>Choose an amount or experience and agree on the purpose, recipient, and reporting.</li><li>Confirm team and club approval, then finalize the recognition and payment arrangements.</li></ol><a href="/#sponsor" class="button">View partnership options ↗</a><p class="fine">Use the sponsorship inquiry form on the team page, or reply to the employee who shared this proposal. No funds are collected on this site.</p></div></section></main><footer class="wrap"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand-symbol">13</span><span>TRIANGLE <b>13 BLACK / NATIONAL</b></span></a><p>Prepared for discussion with Gametime.<br />Parent-led. No affiliation or sponsorship agreement implied.</p><a href={guide}>Official program guide ↗</a></footer><script>document.querySelector('#print')?.addEventListener('click',()=>window.print());</script></body></html>
